title: 'statement-store: time only the measured operation in the store benchmarks'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The statement store benchmarks time only the operation that they are named after. The store
    and its directory are dropped outside the timing, maintain purges the removed statements, and
    the contention benchmark times only the readers. Every benchmark checks its results.
crates:
- name: sc-statement-store
  bump: none
